{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final Quest II</h2>Return to the world of Paylea in Final Quest II. In an action-packed adventure, join Ralph and friends on an epic voyage to find his lost father. Have you got what it takes to confront the Dormai Empire? <br>Your actions will define how the story evolves, multiple paths and choices will result in different endings. <br><br>If you didn't play Final Quest that's OK. Final Quest II is a standalone game. For the best experience in FQII however, we do recommend playing the first game in the series.<br><br><br><strong>Final Quest II Features:</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Return to the world of Paylea. Explore and adventure through a vast world with a variety of unique environments<br></li><li>Find and recruit allies to your team<br></li><li>Unlock hidden areas with secret passwords<br></li><li>Recruit monsters to be your pets<br></li><li>New treasure hunter system - Dig and find items <br></li><li>New Pixel weather system<br></li><li>Mini games<br></li><li>Collect weapons, armours and secret key items.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"55a5198be525ae0715a79f490467d90b81917464.jpg","localized_name":"The End","name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/540020/55a5198be525ae0715a79f490467d90b81917464.jpg"},{"icon":"8310880dd7cc4ef9b493a170dc7afafd7837b634.jpg","localized_name":"The start of anew journey","name":"The start of anew journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/540020/8310880dd7cc4ef9b493a170dc7afafd7837b634.jpg"},{"icon":"21a8468f8e577ee5ac23cae2218617e47cf03182.jpg","localized_name":"Diamond film","name":"Diamond film","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/540020/21a8468f8e577ee5ac23cae2218617e47cf03182.jpg"},{"icon":"2c69fc79840a47c8c4c7a995cdfb49f850a9e2fc.jpg","localized_name":"I found a potion!","name":"I found a potion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s